mail	1567.00	ignite	site	1	1	Bree Okafor, Ignite Partnerships	Poker that's actually fun	Hi, it's Bree from Ignite Poker. We hear you play a lot of tournaments, so here's ours: Flip & Run every hour, The Spark every night at 8 PM, and tables a lot friendlier than the ones you're used to. Open an account and we'll match your first deposit 100%, up to $100. The match comes off as you play, $5 for every $20 of rake inside 60 days. Accept below and your Cashier's ready.
mail	1567.00	ignite	site	10	0	Bree Okafor, Ignite Partnerships	You're in	Welcome to Ignite. Your account's open. Deposits go in by card for a 3% fee, $10 minimum, and we match the first one up to $100. Withdrawals reach your bank in three to five days, $3 each. Have fun out there. That's the whole idea.
mail	1567.00	riverline	site	10	0	RiverLine Player Relations	We noticed	We saw some of your bankroll head to another site. No hard feelings, everybody shops around. But you've played with us since your first night, so for the next 60 days your RiverLine Rewards sit one tier up, on us. The Night Shift's still the Night Shift.
mail	1567.00	runittwice	site	1	1	Ingrid Vale, RunItTwice Player Development	An invitation from RunItTwice	This is Ingrid Vale at RunItTwice. We like to say hello early. We run tournaments for grown-ups: bigger guarantees, lower rake at the top, and fields that make you earn it. Make a first deposit of $50 or more and we'll put $33 in tickets on your account: a $22 Sunday Grind and two $5.50 Supper Stacks. Accept below and the Cashier's yours.
mail	1567.00	runittwice	site	10	0	Ingrid Vale, RunItTwice Player Development	Your RunItTwice account is open	Welcome to RunItTwice. Card deposits cost 2.5%, $10 minimum. Withdrawals reach your bank in 48 hours for a $5 fee. A first deposit of $50 or more brings your $33 in tickets, and the Second Run Club pays rakeback on the 1st once a month's rake passes $50. Good luck at the tables.
mail	1567.00	runittwice	site	10	0	Ingrid Vale, RunItTwice Player Development	Your tickets are in	Thanks for the deposit. A $22 Sunday Grind ticket and two $5.50 Supper Stack tickets are on your account. Register for either and the ticket goes in before your balance does.
